o expand to take up more lines. clicking again makes it a single line again.\r\n\r\nsimilarly but alternatively, you could make the bar's expanded state triggered on hover, and while hovered, show an additional pin icon that could be pressed to make the expanded state stick until unpinned.\r\n\r\n(for this particular error, it would be nice if we could eventually show it inline... an 'angry ghost' of an unhandled case below the last case)\r\n\r\nextremely rough mockup:\r\n![hazel longer ci mockup](https://github.com/hazelgrove/hazel/assets/22436459/b6a17c7b-061b-4aad-bb72-3d21f398c132)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hazelgrove/hazel/issues/comments/1945342639/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hazelgrove/hazel/issues/comments/2251214512","html_url":"https://github.com/hazelgrove/hazel/pull/1139#issuecomment-2251214512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hazelgrove/hazel/issues/1139","id":2251214512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBMdeZM6GLs6w","user":{"login":"cyrus-","id":280638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDYzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/280638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-","html_url":"https://github.com/cyrus-","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus-/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrus